# Inventive Wingsmith's condition counts only spells Bot1 casts from Bot1's hand (CR 601.2a). Turn one: Mox Pearls, a Mox Jet and
# the Wingsmith itself are all cast from hand: no counter. Turn three: Lingering Souls cast from hand: no counter at that end
# step either. Turn five: Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt in Bot1's turn and Bot1 flashes Lingering Souls back from the graveyard,
# neither counts, so the counter is put on at that end step.

